      "id": "blk_qq9s31w",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<p><b>Vilay S1 </b>is<span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">&nbsp;compact industrial metal 3D printer designed to make metal additive manufacturing accessible to educational institutions, research laboratories, startups, and industrial design teams. Built on proven Laser Powder Bed Fusion (LPBF) technology, the Vilay S1 delivers precision metal part production in a compact footprint while maintaining industrial-grade performance.</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_m88s0sk",
      "type": "image",
      "src": "data:image/webp;base64,",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_te369ms",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<h2>Key Features</h2><h3>Compact Industrial Footprint</h3><p>Space-efficient design allows deployment in research labs, educational institutions, innovation centers, and small production environments.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600;\">High-Performance 500W Fiber Laser</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">Equipped with a 500W industrial fiber laser system for precise energy delivery and reliable metal powder fusion.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600;\">Precision Printing</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">Supports powder layer thicknesses from 20–100 microns for fine detail and high-quality surface finishes.</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">High-Speed Scanning System</span></h3><p>Integrated high-speed galvanometer optical system delivers scanning speeds up to 10 m/s for efficient production.</p><h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">Industrial Cooling System</span></h3><p>Dedicated water-cooled laser system ensures thermal stability and long operational life.</p><h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">Magnetic Build Plate System</span></h3><p>Magnetic suction build plate fixing simplifies plate handling and improves operational convenience.</p><h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">Inert Gas Compatible</span></h3><p>Supports Nitrogen (N²) and Argon (Ar) shielding environments for reliable metal printing performance.</p><h3><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">Windows-Based Workflow</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">Compatible with Windows 10 and Windows 11 environments for easy integration into existing workflows.</span></p>"
    }
  ]
}